{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "抓住谢灵账目不净的把柄  (Catching Xie Ling's Expense-Account Habit)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After tricking Xie Ling's deputy into talking over strong cocktails, Bu Xiaogu calls an emergency huddle with Kaiwen and Xingzi to show them a bracelet billed to a company project invoice. Listen to their Mandarin huddle first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "什么事啊，紧急集合非叫到这儿来？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是徐胖送我的，他说这个手镯要走项目发票报销。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这才几天啊，我就知道伦敦灵死性不改！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，这话怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谢灵手脚不干净，制作流程中说不清楚的经济问题，早在艾米时就有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大因为这个跟他发生过争执，他因此记恨上老大，仇就是这么结下的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来老大离开艾米，没人能制衡他，我和凯文坚信他在账目上依然有问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行了，这回有证据了，董事长眼里揉不进沙子，拿去举报他就完了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等等，我觉得现在时机还不够成熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你现在真稳哪，越来越像老大了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还听徐胖说，谢灵要绕过邓主任，直接联系电视台高层对魅力远航痛下杀手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "几个意思啊？他到底想干吗呀？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "什么事啊，紧急集合非叫到这儿来？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is going on that you called an emergency huddle right here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是徐胖送我的，他说这个手镯要走项目发票报销。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xie Ling's deputy gave me this bracelet and admitted he billed the receipt to a project expense account.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这才几天啊，我就知道伦敦灵死性不改！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has barely been here a few days—I knew London Ling could never change his spots!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，这话怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, what do you mean by that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谢灵手脚不干净，制作流程中说不清楚的经济问题，早在艾米时就有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xie Ling has sticky fingers; murky financial dealings inside production budgets go all the way back to ME.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大因为这个跟他发生过争执，他因此记恨上老大，仇就是这么结下的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss clashed with him over it, which made him resent the boss—that was how their feud began.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来老大离开艾米，没人能制衡他，我和凯文坚信他在账目上依然有问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once the boss left ME and nobody could check him, Kaiwen and I were certain his accounts stayed shady.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行了，这回有证据了，董事长眼里揉不进沙子，拿去举报他就完了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great, now we have proof; the chairwoman tolerates zero corruption, so let us go report him right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等等，我觉得现在时机还不够成熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on—I do not think the timing is ripe enough yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你现在真稳哪，越来越像老大了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look how steady you have become—more and more like the boss!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还听徐胖说，谢灵要绕过邓主任，直接联系电视台高层对魅力远航痛下杀手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His deputy also let slip that Xie Ling is bypassing Director Deng to contact network brass directly and kill Charming Voyage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "几个意思啊？他到底想干吗呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is his deal? What on earth is he trying to pull?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "什么事啊，紧急集合非叫到这儿来？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是徐胖送我的，他说这个手镯要走项目发票报销。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这才几天啊，我就知道伦敦灵死性不改！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，这话怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谢灵手脚不干净，制作流程中说不清楚的经济问题，早在艾米时就有。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大因为这个跟他发生过争执，他因此记恨上老大，仇就是这么结下的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来老大离开艾米，没人能制衡他，我和凯文坚信他在账目上依然有问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行了，这回有证据了，董事长眼里揉不进沙子，拿去举报他就完了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等等，我觉得现在时机还不够成熟。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你现在真稳哪，越来越像老大了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还听徐胖说，谢灵要绕过邓主任，直接联系电视台高层对魅力远航痛下杀手。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "几个意思啊？他到底想干吗呀？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Impressed by Xiaogu's newfound poise when she holds off reporting Xie Ling prematurely, Kaiwen and Xingzi hear an even more urgent threat against Charming Voyage. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
